		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Sailing vessel of bones. Arms, ribs, skull, and the like form the hull. Tattered skin-sails. Manned by specters.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 62, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 slam +8 (4d6) or 4 cannon (far) +8 (3d6), <strong>MV</strong> double near (swim), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +5, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 13</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead Boarders</strong>. 3/day, disgorge 1d4 shadows or 1d6 skeletons that appear within near. They stay for 5 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Unholy Repair</strong>. 1/day, as an action, pull flotsam, bones, and carcasses into ship, regain 5d10 HP.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
